---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refund & Cancellation Policy ✦ Dosezy Billing Protections">
	<Header />
	<main class="flex-grow pt-28 sm:pt-32 pb-16 bg-[#030407] bg-grid-pattern">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			
			<!-- Header -->
			<div class="mb-10">
				<span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/20">
					BILLING TERMS & GUARANTEE
				</span>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-display tracking-tight">
					Refund & Cancellation Policy
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-3 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400">
					Effective Date: September 7, 2026 | Document Revision 2.4
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Main Container Card -->
			<div class="vercel-card p-6 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 space-y-8">
				
				<!-- Highlight Banner -->
				<div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-200 text-xs leading-relaxed flex items-start space-x-3">
					<span class="text-lg shrink-0">🛡️</span>
					<div class="space-y-1">
						<strong class="font-bold text-white">14-Day Money-Back Guarantee:</strong>
						<p>All optional Dosezy Caregiver Cloud managed subscriptions include a hassle-free, 14-day 100% money-back guarantee. The core Dosezy Patient App, iOS clients, and Docker Self-Host Node are 100% free forever without subscriptions or hidden fees.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Legal Clauses -->
				<div class="space-y-8 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
					
					<section class="space-y-3">
						<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display flex items-center space-x-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">01.</span>
							<span>Free Open-Source Core Applications ($0.00 USD)</span>
						</h2>
						<p>The core Dosezy Android Patient App, iOS client components, and Docker Self-Hosted Server Node are published under the GPL-3.0 license and are 100% free forever. Downloading, building, or running these core offline applications requires zero payment, credit card details, or subscription contracts.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="space-y-3">
						<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display flex items-center space-x-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">02.</span>
							<span>Caregiver Cloud 14-Day Refund Guarantee</span>
						</h2>
						<p>For users who choose to subscribe to our optional managed cloud synchronization service (Dosezy Caregiver Cloud), we provide a <strong>14-day 100% money-back guarantee</strong> calculated from your initial purchase timestamp or monthly renewal date.</p>
						<p>If you are unsatisfied with the cloud synchronization service for any reason during the initial 14 days, you are entitled to a full 100% refund of your subscription fee with no penalty or hidden processing deductions.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="space-y-3">
						<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display flex items-center space-x-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">03.</span>
							<span>Refund Request Procedure</span>
						</h2>
						<p>To request a refund within your 14-day eligibility window, simply contact our billing department by emailing <a href="mailto:support@dosezy.com" class="text-sky-300 hover:underline font-mono">support@dosezy.com</a> or <a href="mailto:saad@dosezy.com" class="text-sky-300 hover:underline font-mono">saad@dosezy.com</a>. Please provide:</p>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-400">
							<li>Your account email address;</li>
							<li>Transaction ID or invoice reference number.</li>
						</ul>
						<p>Approved refunds are processed back to your original payment card or payment method within 3 to 5 business days, depending on your financial institution's processing timeline.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="space-y-3">
						<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display flex items-center space-x-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">04.</span>
							<span>Single-Click Subscription Cancellation Terms</span>
						</h2>
						<p>You may cancel your Caregiver Cloud subscription at any time with a single click in your web account settings dashboard. Upon cancellation:</p>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-400">
							<li>Your account will be set to non-renewing status immediately;</li>
							<li>You will retain full access to cloud synchronization services through the end of your current paid billing period;</li>
							<li>No further recurring charges will occur.</li>
						</ul>
					</section>

					<section class="space-y-3">
						<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display flex items-center space-x-2">
							<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">05.</span>
							<span>Dispute Resolution & Chargebacks</span>
						</h2>
						<p>We encourage subscribers to contact billing support directly at <a href="mailto:support@dosezy.com" class="text-sky-300 hover:underline font-mono">support@dosezy.com</a> before initiating a credit card chargeback dispute. We resolve 100% of legitimate refund requests promptly without fees.</p>
					</section>

				</div>

			</div>

		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
